          <li><strong>Zero migration risk</strong> — Keep your CMS; commerce runs in an isolated widget</li>
          <li><strong>Multi-channel selling</strong> — Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, Amazon, eBay, and POS</li>
          <li><strong>PCI-compliant checkout</strong> — Hosted by Lightspeed; no extra PCI scope on your site</li>
        </ul>
